  "instruction": "从每题的A、B、C三个选项中选择最合适的一项。两空题选择一个完整组合，每题只填一个字母。",
  "items": [
    {
      "stem": "Keep your voice low. Don't ____!",
      "key": "B",
      "options": [
        "smile",
        "shout",
        "sit"
      ],
      "grounds": [
        "微笑不违反低声要求，不能表达此处禁止大声的意思。",
        "shout指大声喊，正与前句低声要求相对。",
        "坐下不涉及音量，不合这条提醒。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "stem": "—Is this a ruler? —____ It is a long ruler.",
      "key": "C",
      "options": [
        "No, it isn't.",
        "I don't know.",
        "Yes, it is."
      ],
      "grounds": [
        "后句明确是尺子，与否定冲突。",
        "后句已明确其身份，不合不知道。",
        "后句long ruler明确支持肯定回答。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "stem": "Six crayons are inside the box. —What are those ____ the box? —____ crayons.",
      "key": "A",
      "options": [
        "in; They're",
        "on; They're",
        "in; It's"
      ],
      "grounds": [
        "inside对应in，those及复数crayons对应They are。",
        "on表示表面上，与inside不同。",
        "those和crayons是复数，不能用It is。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "stem": "—What's this? —____ It is for writing.",
      "key": "B",
      "options": [
        "She's my aunt.",
        "It's a pencil.",
        "He's Ben."
      ],
      "grounds": [
        "介绍女性，不能回答所问书写物品。",
        "a pencil是可以写字的物品，回答this所指物。",
        "介绍男性，不合this及书写用途。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "stem": "—____ my bag? —It's under the desk.",
      "key": "C",
      "options": [
        "Who's",
        "What's",
        "Where's"
      ],
      "grounds": [
        "问谁，不以桌下的位置作答。",
        "问是什么，不合后句位置回答。",
        "询问书包位置，由under the desk回答。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "stem": "—Look at my new kite. —____ nice!",
      "key": "A",
      "options": [
        "How",
        "What a",
        "What"
      ],
      "grounds": [
        "How后可接形容词nice作感叹。",
        "What a后需形容词加单数名词，题面没有名词。",
        "此结构不能仅接形容词nice结束。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "stem": "—Do you have an ____? —No, I do not.",
      "key": "C",
      "options": [
        "pencil",
        "books",
        "egg"
      ],
      "grounds": [
        "pencil以辅音音素开头，不接an。",
        "books是复数，不接an。",
        "egg是元音音素开头的单数词，和an相配。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "stem": "—Are these ____? —No, ____.",
      "key": "B",
      "options": [
        "duck; they aren't",
        "ducks; they aren't",
        "ducks; they are"
      ],
      "grounds": [
        "these要求复数，不用单数duck。",
        "these ducks复数一致，No接they are not。",
        "No和肯定they are冲突。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "stem": "—Would you like some milk? —____",
      "key": "A",
      "options": [
        "No, thanks.",
        "No, I don't.",
        "You are welcome."
      ],
      "grounds": [
        "对食物饮料的邀请可礼貌谢绝。",
        "此处回答Would you like的邀请，不用助动词do照答。",
        "不是收到感谢，不能用不用谢回应邀请。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "stem": "My kite is yellow and green. —What colour is your kite? —____",
      "key": "C",
      "options": [
        "Red and white.",
        "Blue and black.",
        "Yellow and green."
      ],
      "grounds": [
        "与题面yellow and green不符。",
        "与题面两种颜色不符。",
        "直接符合题面已给颜色，不依赖未提供的图片。"
      ]
    }
  ],
